<div class="space-y-6 lg:max-w-3xl">

<div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-season" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-season">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">When is the best time for sightings?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Whale season in Cabo runs from mid-December to mid-April. Morning tours often have calmer waters, while afternoon winds can sometimes lead to more active whale behavior.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-species" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-species">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">Which whale species can we see in Cabo?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">The most common sightings are humpback and gray whales. Occasionally, visitors may spot blue whales, orcas, or whale sharks in the surrounding waters.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-origin" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-origin">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">Where do the whales come from?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Most whales in Cabo migrate from the cold waters of Alaska and Canada. They travel thousands of miles to the warm lagoons of Baja to mate and give birth.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-responsible" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-responsible">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">Responsible whale watching</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">We strictly follow environmental guidelines to minimize impact. This includes maintaining safe distances, limiting observation time, and avoiding any disruption to their natural behavior.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-menu" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-menu">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-semibold text-navy"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gold" style="font-size:18px">restaurant</span>Cruise Menu &amp; Bar</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
          <div><p class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Bar</p><p>Premium open bar includes red &amp; white wine, margaritas, beer, rum, vodka, tequila, whiskey, juices, sodas, and bottled water.</p></div>
          <div><p class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Food</p><p>Tortilla chips with Mexican salsa &amp; homemade guacamole, fresh baguette sandwiches, fresh-cut fruit platter, and a sweet bite to finish.</p></div>
          <div class="border-t border-border-light pt-3"><p><span class="font-semibold text-navy">Mexican option (+$14 USD per person):</span> Tortilla chips, salsa &amp; guacamole, beef &amp; chicken corn tortilla burritos, rice &amp; beans, quesadillas, dessert.</p></div>
          <p class="text-slate-500 italic">Contact our office team for Kosher, Vegan or Vegetarian options.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-bring" type="checkbox"/>
